Integrated Master Schedule(IMS):
 A schedule that includes the entire scope of effort,
including the effort from government, contractor, and
other key parties of a program for successful execution
from start to finish.
Analysis Schedule: Summary schedule based on
Integrated Master schedule used to conduct schedule
risk analysis and integrated cost and schedule analysis.
 Maintain attributes of IMS: Task type, constraints,
predecessor, successor, float, criticality, and start and
finish dates.
Schedule Types

